farwa ke dulare aye qasim<br>
kyon chodgaya mujh ko dilbar<br>
ab gham se tere phat ta hai jigar<br>
bin tere bata dukhiya madar<br>
din kaise guzarey aye qasim<br>
<br>
1. kubra ne kaha waali utho<br>
khamosh ho kyun ab kuch to kaho<br>
tum chod gaye mujh ko bolo<br>
ab kis ke saharey aye qasim<br>
<br>
2. iss tarha mera ujda hai chaman<br>
pamaal huwa hai tera badan<br>
masroof-e-buka hain rooh-e-hassan<br>
ab gham mein tumharey aye qasim<br>
<br>
3. aye lal mere sotay ho kaha<br>
kis tarha tumhe dhundegi yeh maa<br>
hai gham se mere ankhon mein dhuvan<br>
maa kis ko pukare aye qasim<br>
<br>
4. rokar yeh haram sab kehte hain<br>
dulha ke badan ke tukde hain<br>
jis tarha se ran mein bikhray hain<br>
qurran ke parey aye qasim<br>
<br>
5. khaimo mein hain shor-e-aaho buka<br>
hain nouha kuna sara kunba<br>
sar peet ti hain gham se kubra<br>
tum jab se sidharey aye qasim<br>
<br>
6. betab jo bache hotey hain<br>
pani kay liye jaan khotey hain<br>
abbas-e-dilawar sootey hain<br>
dariya kay kinare aye qasim<br>
<br>
7. aye mahve buka sajjad nazar<br>
razvi ki hai ankhen ashkoon say tar<br>
nouho mein hamare dijeye asar<br>
hum sab kay sahare aye qasim